msgid ""
"**Description**: List all public collections available on SynBioHub. "
"Collections are curated sets of genetic parts and designs, including the "
"iGEM Parts Registry, CIDAR Lab parts, Free Genes feature libraries, and "
"organism-specific collections. Returns collection names, descriptions, "
"URIs, and member counts. Use this to discover available part libraries "
"before searching for specific parts."
